      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了把$a-(b+c)$式化成$a-b-c$式，我们的作法如下：",
        "1) 去掉括号和括号前边的“$-$”号；",
        "2) 把括号里面各个加数的符号改成相反的符号."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**如果括号前面是“$-$”号，在去括号时，把括号里面的每一**",
        "**个加数的符号都改成相反的符号.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2.去掉$a-(-b+c-k)$式中的括号.在括号里是",
        "$-b,c,-k$的和.括号前面是“$-$”号.去括号得：",
        "$a-(-b+c-k)$",
        "$=a+b-c+k$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例3.去掉式$-(a+b)$中的括号.这个算式可以写成：",
        "$-(a+b)=0-(a+b)$",
        "$=0-a-b=-a-b$.",
        "即：$-(a+b)=-a-b$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "435",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "去掉下列各式中的括号",
        "1) $a+(b+c)$；　　3) $a+(b-c)$；",
        "2) $a+(-b+c)$；4) $a+(-b-c)$.",
        "设$a=15,b=34,c=-20$，检验所得等式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "436",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "去掉下列各式中的括号：",
        "1) $a-(b+c)$；　　3) $a-(b-c)$；",
        "2) $a-(-b+c)$；　　4) $a-(-b-c)$.",
        "设$a=-2.1,b=6.1,c=-2.6$，检验所得等式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "437",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用图100的1和2，证明下列各对数是相反数：",
        "1) $-a-2$和$a+2$；",
        "2) $-a+2$和$a-2$."
      ]
    },
    {
